		<h3 id="scoutingplantitforward-label">Scouting Plant It Forward</h3>
		<h4><a href="https://scoutingplantitforward.org/" rel="external" target="_blank">Website</a></h4>
		<p>A fundraising website for Northern Star Scouting, offering an alternative to the traditional popcorn sale: instead of a product, donors fund a native tree planted in the Superior National Forest through the Arbor Day Foundation, keeping the benefit local to the community that donates. Proceeds are split evenly between the participating Scout and the council, which covers card-processing fees and tree-planting logistics. For the full technical writeup, check out the <a href="/projects#scoutingplantitforward">Scouting Plant It Forward entry of the projects page</a>.</p>
		<h4>Technologies</h4>
		<p>ScoutingPlantItForward.org starts from the same Eleventy (11ty) static build as this site, but layers a Cloudflare Workers backend on top to handle logins, payments, and reporting: Clover's iframe integration for PCI-light card processing, Cloudflare D1/KV for accounts and sessions, PBKDF2-SHA256 password hashing, and an n8n workflow that triggers a nightly rebuild so figures like the homepage's "trees planted" counter stay current.</p>
