		<h3 id="vehicle-maintenance-tracker-label">Vehicle Maintenance Tracker</h3>
		<h4>An Android Application | <a href="https://github.com/Pretz333/Vehicle-Maintenance-Tracker" rel="external" target="_blank">GitHub Repository</a></h4>
		<p>An Open-Source Android Application to track vehicle maintenance. It utilizes a database (with full CRUD abilities) to track the vehicles and issues of those vehicles. With a few minor tweaks, this codebase could be made into a general issue (bug) tracker or support ticket manager.</p>
		<h4>Technologies</h4>
		<p>This project was built in Android Studio using Java and uses an SQLite Database to track the vehicles, issues, and logs.</p>
